The '''fourteenth series''' of ''[[The Great British Bake Off]]'' began on 26 September 2023.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.radiotimes.com/tv/entertainment/great-british-bake-off-2023-release-date/|title=Great British Bake Off 2023: Release date, hosts and latest news|website=Radio Times}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.heart.co.uk/showbiz/tv-movies/when-is-the-great-british-bake-off-on-start-date-time-channel-revealed/|title=When is The Great British Bake Off on? Start date and time revealed|website=Heart}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.digitalspy.com/tv/reality-tv/a45122070/bake-off-release-date-season-14/|title=Bake Off confirms release date for new series|date=13 September 2023|website=Digital Spy}}</ref> In December 2022, [[Matt Lucas]] announced his departure from the show after three series as a co-presenter.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.bbc.com/news/entertainment-arts-63879887|title=Matt Lucas ends run as Great British Bake Off host|date=6 December 2022|website=BBC News}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|last1=Media |first1=P. A. |url=https://www.theguardian.com/tv-and-radio/2022/dec/06/great-british-bake-off-matt-lucas-leave-presenting-role|title=Matt Lucas to leave The Great British Bake Off |work=The Guardian |date=6 December 2022 }}</ref> In March 2023, [[Alison Hammond]] was announced as his replacement and joined [[Noel Fielding]] as co-host.<ref>{{Cite news|url=https://www.bbc.com/news/entertainment-arts-64986451|title=The Great British Bake Off: Alison Hammond replaces Matt Lucas as co-host|work=BBC News |date=17 March 2023}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.channel4.com/press/news/baking-news-alison-hammond-joins-bake|title=Baking news... Alison Hammond joins Bake Off |publisher=Channel 4}}</ref> [[Paul Hollywood]] and [[Prue Leith]] returned to judge the series.<ref>{{Cite news|url=https://www.bbc.com/news/entertainment-arts-66689042|title=The Great British Bake Off scraps national-themed weeks after criticism|work=BBC News |date=1 September 2023}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/tv/news/bake-off-presenters-2023-who-judges-b2418118.html|title=Who are the hosts and judges of this year's Great British Bake Off?|date=25 September 2023|website=The Independent}}</ref> The bakers competing in the series were announced on 18 September 2023, and included the show’s first ever deaf contestant.<ref>{{cite news |last1=Mensah |first1=Katelyn |title=Bake Off stars learned sign language for show's first ever deaf baker |url=https://www.radiotimes.com/tv/entertainment/great-british-bake-off-first-deaf-baker-newsupdate/ |access-date=18 April 2024 |work=RadioTimes.com |publisher=Radio Times |date=19 September 2023}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|url=https://www.theguardian.com/tv-and-radio/2023/sep/19/the-2023-great-british-bake-off-contestants-ranked|title=The 2023 Great British Bake Off contestants – ranked!|first=Stuart|last=Heritage|date=19 September 2023|newspaper=The Guardian}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.channel4.com/press/news/bakers-revealed-great-british-bake-series-14|title=Bakers Revealed for The Great British Bake Off Series 14 |publisher=Channel 4}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.bbc.com/newsround/66841394|title=Great British Bake Off 2023 contestants, judges and theme weeks!|date=19 September 2023|publisher=BBC}}</ref>

The series was won by Matty Edgell, with Dan Hunter and Josh Smalley finishing as the runners-up.<ref>{{cite web|url= https://www.theguardian.com/tv-and-radio/live/2023/nov/28/the-great-british-bake-off-final-live|title=The Great British Bake Off final – as it happened|date=28 November 2023|work=Guardian|accessdate=29 November 2023}}</ref>

