=== Episode 2: Biscuits ===
In Biscuit Week the signature bake was twelve Marshmallow biscuits of whatever form in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours. In the technical challenge, set by Prue, the bakers had {{frac|1|1|2}} hours to bake twelve [[custard cream]] biscuits. The showstopper challenge gave them four hours to bake an Illusion Biscuit display which represented the bakers favourite meal.
