=== Episode 3: Bread ===
The bakers were tasked with making their own [[cottage loaf]] in {{frac|2|3|4}} hours for the signature challenge. For the technical challenge, set by Paul, the task was baking 8 Devonshire Splits, i.e. buns which are split in half and are filled with [[Fruit preserves#Jam|jam]], [[clotted cream]] and strawberries, in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours. In the showstopper, the bakers were given four hours to make a sweet or savoury Plaited Centrepiece Loaf that featured two different types of flour.

