=== Episode 4: Chocolate ===
A "luxurious" chocolate [[torte]], to be made without [[wheat flour]] in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours, was set as the signature challenge. The technical challenge, set by Prue, required six individual-sized caramelized white chocolate and [[blackcurrant]] [[cheesecake|cheesecakes]] to be baked in two hours. For the showstopper the bakers were given four hours to make an "Edible Chocolate Box Cake" — an edible chocolate box with filled molded chocolates and containing a chocolate cake. 
