=== Episode 5: Pastry ===

For the signature challenge, the bakers were required to produce twelve individual savoury [[Pork_pie#Variations|picnic pies]], made with [[hot water crust pastry]], in two hours. The technical challenge, set by Paul, asked the bakers to bake a [[Dauphinoise potatoes|Dauphinoise]] [[Pithivier]], using [[Flaky pastry|flaky "rough puff" pastry]] and accompanied by a [[blue cheese]] sauce, in two hours and forty-five minutes. The showstopper challenge tasked the bakers with making a decorative sweet pie display with a minimum of three pies, in fours hours; the judges expected them to have a sweet pastry case.

