=== Episode 8: Party (Quarterfinals) ===
The signature challenge required the bakers to make twelve [[sausage roll]]s, using the pastry of their choice, in two hours. The technical challenge, set by Paul, asked the bakers to make a chocolate [[Colin the Caterpillar|caterpillar cake]] in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours.<ref>{{cite web |title=Paul Hollywood's Caterpillar Cake |url=https://thegreatbritishbakeoff.co.uk/recipes/all/paul-hollywoods-caterpillar-cake/ |website=The Great British Bake Off |publisher=Love Productions Ltd. |access-date=27 April 2024}}</ref> The bakers had 4½ hours to make their showstopper challenge, a colourful and decorative 'Anything But Beige' Buffet display of a mixture of sweet and savory party foods, baking at least 12 of each item.
