=== Episode 10: Final ===
The final signature challenge tasked the bakers with making eight [[Éclair|éclairs]] in two different flavors, in two hours and fifteen minutes. The final technical challenge, set by Paul, asked the bakers to make nine [[Lardy cake]] slices in three hours. The final showstopper challenge was for the bakers to make an elegant celebration cake with at least three tiers, inspired by their first bake, in {{frac|4|1|2}} half hours.  Based on the judges' comments during deliberations, Dan can be seen as an unofficial third place, as they said Josh and Matty were in line to win.
