=== ''The Great New Year Bake Off'' ===
The Great New Year Bake Off featured Mark Lutton from [[The Great British Bake Off (series 11)|Series 11]], Jürgen Krauss and Maggie Richardson both from [[The Great British Bake Off (series 12)|Series 12]], and Maxy Maligisa from [[The Great British Bake Off (series 13)|Series 13]].

The signature challenge was for the bakers to make 12 [[Religieuse]] with a festive theme in two hours. The technical challenge, set by Paul, was for the bakers to make a [[King cake|Galette Des Rois]] with crisp, buttery pastry and an almond frangipane filling in two hours. The showstopper challenge was for the bakers to create an exquisite New Year’s Smash Cake that had a chocolate dome shell, in 4 hours.
 
